arare Institute of Technology (HIT).  Data points include student IDs, degrees, specializations, class of degree, and award dates. The initial focus is on the data structure consistency.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\src\\main\\java\\com\\devops\\qvs\\config\\DataInitializer.java","EndLine":180,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"View DataInitializer.java","toolSummary":"Review DataInitializer.java structure"}}]}
